{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124340","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012434001:0":{"text":"로잔, 눈은 왜 그래? 모래 들어갔어?","source_cn":"洛桑，你的眼睛怎么了？进了沙子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F947558D7E4F76D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012434002:0":{"text":"아니, 조금 전에 또 검은 나비를 본 것 같아. 달빛 그림자의 사람들이 검은 나비는 불길한 징조라고 하던데... 그래서 걱정돼.","source_cn":"不是，我刚刚好像又看到了黑蝴蝶。月影乡的人说，黑蝴蝶预...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96D326784E3D0A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012434003:1":{"text":"너무 피곤해서 그런 거 아니야?","source_cn":"你是不是太累了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3682B7E971B9DC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012434004:2":{"text":"그럴 수도... 최근 잠을 잘 못 잤으니까.","source_cn":"有可能……最近都没能好好睡觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660B54DB6500D115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012434005:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 처음 본 것도 아니고. 위대한 마스터가 있으니 아무 일 없을 거랍니닷!","source_cn":"别怕，我们也不是第一次遇见它啦。有伟大的梅林在，绝对不...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0619A331BB2C13B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"걱정 마세요. 처음 본 것도 아니고. 위대한 마스터가 있으니 아무 일 없을 거랍니닷!","female":"걱정 마세요. 처음 본 것도 아니고. 위대한 마스터가 있으니 아무 일 없을 거랍니닷!","variant_male_record_index":"111630","variant_female_record_index":"111631","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012434006:2":{"text":"맞아! 기운 내야 해. 기도의 날이 왔으니, 어서 영혼의 언덕으로 가서 미샤르테에게 인도를 구하자.","source_cn":"说的也是！我得打起精神。祈福日到了，我们赶紧前往鹿灵圣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EDC0DA17D5708F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012434007:1":{"text":"에이론과 브라이언은 이미 갔으니 거기서 그들과 합류하자.","source_cn":"埃隆和布莱恩已经过去了，我们在那边与他们汇合吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A83DEEDB45810BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}